      "source": "import { gmail as gmail_module } from adapters; mail = connect gmail_module\nfunction filed(e: <mail-[:Message]->>) { return e.Subject }\nlisten to mail-[e:Messages WHERE e.Query == \"from:acme\" AND e.Subject CONTAINS \"invoice\"]-> fire filed\n",
